The awk program avoids gawk extensions, but it has only run with
gawk here; mawk and busybox awk are untested.

Tested in scratch repos with GNU sed 4.9 absent from the path: drop
by full sha and by HEAD~2, an unmatched rev (the rebase does not
start and HEAD is unchanged), an unknown action, a fixup and a move
under rebase.abbreviateCommands, rebase.instructionFormat,
--rebase-merges and --update-refs, two actions in one run, a move
across a merge, dropping a merge, and dropping a commit above a
merge.
